SUMMARY: Josh Farley: The Magic Across America Tour
DESCRIPTION:Josh has been seen on the primetime CW television show “Penn 
 & Teller: Fool Us\,” “Masters of Illusion Live!”\, and “Celebrities of Ma
 gic”. and performed as such notable venues as the Walmart Amphitheater in
  Rogers\, Reunion Tower in Dallas\, and the MGM Beau Rivage in Biloxi.\n\
 nGet ready to be a part of a once-in-a-lifetime event! Award-winning illu
 sionist Josh Farley is hitting the road for his “Magic Across America Tou
 r” - a 50-state journey bringing his comedic\, fast-paced\, and mind-blow
 ing magic show across the country.\n\nStarting in Louisville\, KY the tou
 r will take Josh to all 50 states in just 50 weeks. Portland is his 12th 
 stop where he’s Josh excited to be performing at the All American Magic T
 heater\, a 5\,000 sq ft theater and magic shop located in the at the Lloy
 d Center.\n\nGet Tickets at www.magicpdx.com/shows/362155 https://www.mag
 icpdx.com/shows/362155
