SUMMARY: The Tesla City Stories - Season 10 Premiere
DESCRIPTION:The Tesla City Stories is live serialized 1944 radio theater 
 onstage show featuring comedy\, drama\, chills\, romance\, drinks\, eats\
 , prizes\, Foley sound FX\, music. Unique!\n\nThe Tesla City Stories retu
 rn to the stage at the Old Church Concert Hall Friday April 3rd at 7:30 P
 M!\n\nFirst up in an all-new episode of The Wilde Card Mysteries\, a John
  Doe\, a pawn shop ticket\, and a one word message lead P.I. Jack Wilde t
 o the very height of his career\, but it’s quite a long way down in “The 
 Cold Client and the Concertina!”\n\nThen we return to the romantic obstac
 le course that is Blevins to Betsy in an episode entitled “What’s In a Na
 me?” Radio stars Blevins DeBell and Betsy Harper are closer than ever to 
 admitting their feelings for each other\, so what’s stopping them? Plenty
 !\n\nMystery\, comedy\, soap operatics\, and the musical delights of Smut
  City Jellyroll Society!
CATEGORIES:Theater,Live-Performance
