SUMMARY: Mt. Hood Rock Club 2026 Rock & Gem Show
DESCRIPTION:Step into a world of wonder at the Mt. Hood Rock Club's 2026 
 Rock & Gem Show!\n\n\n📅 Save the Date: April 10\, 2026 - April 12th\, 20
 26\n\n🕙 Hours for the show:\n\nDay 1 - April 10th 10am - 5pm\n\nDay 2 - 
 April 11th 9am - 5pm\n\nDay 3 - April 12th 10am - 3pm\n\n📍 Venue: Jackso
 n Armory\, 6255 NE Cornfoot Rd.\, Portland\, OR 97218\n\nThe Mt. Hood Roc
 k Club invites you to a captivating event featuring a diverse showcase of
  geological marvels! Discover a treasure trove of delights with 30+ vendo
 rs offering a stunning array of minerals\, rocks\, beads\, jewelry\, and 
 fossils. Engage with live demonstrators\, and uncover the secrets of lapi
 dary and more with educational exhibits.\n\n🎉 Immerse yourself in the ex
 citement with raffle prizes\, silent auctions\, door prizes\, and an oral
  auction on Sunday\, April 12th! For our young rock enthusiasts\, the Kid
 s' Corner beckons with games and activities to spark their curiosity.\n\n
 🎟️ Admission & parking is free! Join us at the Mt. Hood Rock Club's 2026
  Rock & Gem Show for a weekend filled with wonder and discovery!\n\n#Rock
 GemShow #MtHoodRockClub #PortlandEvents #FamilyFriendlyGemShow
CATEGORIES:Family-Event,Free,Kid-Friendly,Portland-Events
