SUMMARY: Join Handel’s Ice Cream Grand Opening in Hillsboro!
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars for Saturday\, April 18\, as we celebrate
  the grand opening of the newest Handel’s Ice Cream in Oregon! Located at
  3307 SE Reed Drive\, Handel’s invites the community to join the celebrat
 ion starting at 11:00 a.m. For a day of sweet treats and family-friendly 
 fun.\n\nGet there early because the first 100 guests receive FREE Ice Cre
 am for a Year!* The festivities will also include balloon twisting and fa
 ce painting from 12:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m. Guests can look forward to enjoy
 ing 48 rotating flavors made fresh daily on-site.\n\nCan't make it Saturd
 ay? Stop by on Friday\, April 17\, for the official ribbon cutting at 11:
 00 a.m. and enjoy a Buy One\, Get One Free special until 5:00 p.m.\n\nThe
  Hillsboro location is open daily from 11:00 a.m. to 10:00 p.m. The shop 
 offers pickup and delivery services through DoorDash\, Uber Eats\, and Po
 stmates\, as well as catering options for your next event.\n\nFor more in
 formation about Handel’s Hillsboro\, visit https://handelsicecream.com/st
 ore/hillsboro/ https://handelsicecream.com/store/hillsboro/ or follow the
 m on social media for updates.\n\n*Must be 18 years or older to receive t
 he Free Ice Cream for a Year offer.
