  28 as we celebrate the return of our beloved bonsai collection! Come dis
 cover the beauty of these tiny trees through special activities in the Fa
 mily Studio\, bonsai-themed items in the Gift Shop\, Bonsai Society of Po
 rtland Show and demonstrations\, and more! We’ll also have a delightful o
 pportunity to learn more about bonsai in our new Garden Experience Center
