SUMMARY: We Could Be Heroes A Decade of Directing Films and Lives
DESCRIPTION:Outside the Frame Presents:\n\nWe Could Be Heroes\n\nA Decade
  of Directing Films and Lives\n\nAll ages\n\nSliding scale\n\nFor tickets
 : outsidetheframe.org http://outsidetheframe.org\n\nWe are celebrating 10
  years of inspired filmmaking by youth experiencing homelessness. Over th
 e past decade\, we have worked with more than 800 young people\, produced
  175 original films (and counting) and helped change countless life traje
 ctories through film education and creative workforce development.\n\nThi
 s evening showcases new films and archival treasures\, and features new f
 riends\, alumni\, and a lifetime achievement award.
