SUMMARY: Home & Garden Idea Fair
DESCRIPTION:The Clark Public Utilities Home & Garden Idea Fair connects h
 omeowners and renters with more than 200 contractors\, plant nurseries an
 d products that can help enhance their living spaces. Every inch of this 
 year’s 100\,000 square foot show year’s show was curated to offer a uniqu
 e mix of businesses and experts who can bring your inspiration to life\, 
 while also showcasing utility programs and services that help make your h
 ome more comfortable and efficient.\n\nThe show has something for everyon
 e\, even if that’s a new kitchen gadget\, custom gutters or a fun day out
  with the family. Highlights of this year’s event include an expertly des
 igned interactive landscape showcase garden\, live pole climbing demonstr
 ations\, numerous kids’ activities\, food trucks and much\, much more.
