SUMMARY: Bingo Benefiting Charity
DESCRIPTION:All ages BINGO fun with great prizes and of course\, a great 
 time. Come sit with us and get your blackout BINGO on!\n\nWe know the hol
 idays are near which is why we are teaming up with local non-profit group
 s to help and support the community. Take the night off and let Tallman B
 rewing and our Food Trucks cater to your family.\n\nSupport Mid-Willamett
 e Valley charity and non-profit organizations.
