SUMMARY: Portland Spirit Mother's Day Cruise
DESCRIPTION:Sweep mom off her feet this Mother’s Day with a special brunc
 h cruise. The whole family will enjoy a two-hour cruise on the Willamette
  River\, a delicious Northwest brunch buffet\, mimosas or sparkling cider
 \, live piano music and beautiful river views. Make memories that mom wil
 l treasure forever!\n\n\nSchedule:\n\n\nMorning Brunch\nBoarding: 9:30 am
 \nCruising: 10:00 am – 12:00 pm\n\nAfternoon Brunch\nBoarding: 2:00 pm\nC
 ruising: 2:30 pm – 4:30 pm\n\n\nWhat's Included:\n\n  * 2 -hour cruise on
  the Willamette River\n  * Views of the Historic Milwaukie Waterfront and
  downtown Portland\n  * Freshly prepared Northwest brunch buffet\n  * Mim
 osas\, house sparkling wine & sparkling cider\n  * Coffee and tea\n  * As
 sorted miniature desserts\n  * Reserved table\n  * Live piano music\n  * 
 Service charge (gratuity)
