SUMMARY: Comics Confluence Festival
DESCRIPTION:The PSU School of Film presents the second annual Comics Conf
 luence Festival\, a power-packed day of creativity\, insider knowledge\, 
 and comic book magic. Co-presented with the Comic Studies program and spo
 nsored by Dark Horse Comics\, this event features workshops and panel dis
 cussions led by comics industry professionals and legendary creators like
  Kelly Sue DeConnick\, Brian Bendis\, David Walker\, and Diana Schutz. A 
 dedicated tabling section will highlight artwork from students\, recent g
 raduates\, and emerging pros. Connect with fellow fans\, learn from the b
