SUMMARY: 71st Annual Rose Show presented by Fort Vancouver Rose Society
DESCRIPTION:The Fort Vancouver Rose Society presents\n\n\nA Rosy Affair\n
 \n71st Annual Rose Show on Saturday\, May 30\, 2026\n\nClark County Event
  Center at The Fairgrounds\n\nThis event\, open to the public from 1 p.m.
  to 4 p.m.\, will be held at the Clark County Event Center at The Fairgro
 unds in Ridgefield and is anticipated to be the largest rose show in the 
 State of Washington. Both parking and admission are free\, and there is n
 o exhibitor entry fee.\n\nJudging of beautiful roses grown in the Pacific
  Northwest will be governed by current American Rose Society rules and pr
 ocedures. Roses include hybrid teas\, floribundas\, grandifloras\, old ga
 rden and shrub roses\, climbers\, miniatures\, minifloras and micro-minia
 tures in addition to arrangements of large roses\, miniatures minifloras 
 and micro-miniatures. There will also be a Photography section!\n\nAgain\
 , there is no exhibitor entry fee. Rose exhibit entries (Horticulture) an
 d rose arrangement exhibit entries (Artistic Design) will be accepted fro
 m 7:00 a.m. to 10:15 a.m. Photos (5x7) can be mailed to arrive by May 27 
 to Kathy Fry (13108 NE 22nd Street\, Vancouver\, WA 98684) or entered by 
 8:00 a.m. on the day of the show\, May 30. Novices (includes first time e
 xhibitors) and students (youth 18 and under) are welcomed. An Award/Troph
 y Ceremony is scheduled for 3 p.m.\n\nNew this year\, the show will featu
 re a Garden Market where show visitors can purchase rose care/gardening p
 roducts from local vendors. And\, rose care experts--members of The Fort 
 Vancouver Rose Society--will be on site to provide information and answer
  questions regarding rose care.\n\nFor more information regarding rose ex
 hibit entries (Horticulture) and rose arrangement (Artistic Design) exhib
 it entries\, contact Julie Goggin at 360-609-1749 or Sally Rossetto at 36
 0-573-8033. Contact Kathy Fry at 360-823-3155 regarding entering 5x7 Phot
 ography exhibits. Also visit our website at www.fortvancouverrosesociety.
 org http://www.fortvancouverrosesociety.org
CATEGORIES:rose
