SUMMARY: United Way's Iron Chef Goes Coastal
DESCRIPTION:United Way’s Iron Chef Goes Coastal is an exciting\, communit
 y-driven fundraiser that brings together talented local chefs and restaur
 ants for a friendly culinary competition. Attendees can sample delicious 
 bites from dozens of vendors\, casting their votes for favorites in both 
 savory and dessert categories. The highlight of the event is a live\, on-
 stage cooking showdown where chefs compete in real time\, with a panel of
  judges selecting the ultimate winner. As United Way’s largest fundraiser
  of the year\, Iron Chef Goes Coastal plays a vital role in supporting th
 e community—raising a significant portion of the funds distributed annual
 ly to local nonprofits. Every dollar generated goes directly back to thos
 e organizations\, ensuring meaningful impact where it’s needed most.
CATEGORIES:cooking,competition,fundraiser,united-way
